## Sources retain their own rights

Each use case links to and credits an original source: vendor documentation, official examples, community templates, or third-party lists. Those sources remain under the copyright and license terms chosen by their authors and publishers.

CC BY 4.0 covers this repository’s selection, taxonomy, and playbook summaries. It does not transfer, waive, or relicense the underlying source materials. When you reuse a source’s text, template, screenshot, or brand, follow that source’s own terms.
